## 10. Client — Application Structure

```
client/src/
├── app/
│   ├── (auth)/           # Login, Register, OTP pages
│   ├── (protected)/      # Authenticated pages
│   │   ├── dashboard/    # User's projects overview
│   │   ├── editor/       # Collaborative code editor
│   │   ├── discover/     # Browse public projects
│   │   ├── profile/      # User profile & settings
│   │   ├── plan/         # Subscription plans
│   │   ├── starred/      # Starred projects
│   │   └── contributor/  # Contributor management
│   └── (admin)/          # Admin dashboard
├── components/           # Shared UI components (Radix + shadcn/ui)
├── apis/                 # Axios API call functions
├── graphql/              # Apollo queries & mutations
├── hooks/                # Custom React hooks
├── stores/               # Zustand global state
├── context/              # React context providers
├── types/                # TypeScript interfaces
└── lib/                  # Utility helpers
```

---

## 11. Tech Stack Summary

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Frontend** | Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript, TailwindCSS v4 |
| **UI Components** | Radix UI, shadcn/ui, Lucide Icons, Framer Motion |
| **State Management** | Zustand, TanStack Query, Apollo Client |
| **Code Editor** | Monaco Editor (@monaco-editor/react) |
| **Backend** | Node.js, Express 4, TypeScript |
| **Database** | MongoDB + Mongoose ODM |
| **Cache / Queue** | Redis (ioredis), BullMQ |
| **Real-time** | Socket.IO 4 (client + server) |
| **API Style** | REST + GraphQL (Apollo Server) |
| **Auth** | JWT (jsonwebtoken) + bcryptjs + Firebase |
| **Payments** | Razorpay |
| **Email** | Nodemailer |
| **File Storage** | Cloudinary |
| **Code Execution** | Piston (Docker) / Piston-Lite (Cloud) |
| **Logging** | Pino → Loki → Grafana |
| **Containerization** | Docker + Docker Compose |
| **Orchestration** | Kubernetes (k8s/) |
| **Reverse Proxy** | Nginx |
